# Per-element callee with own object creation — refused (besluit 1-A weiger-grens)

The functie-route lowers a PURE callee. `KamerCreatie` is impure: it declares a
subscope of its own (`inner scope Inner`) and so mints its own instance — an own
object creation the list-position identity cannot carry. Refused per element;
Direction B (real per-element instances) is deferred (2026-08-24).

```catala
declaration scope Inner:
  input x content integer
  output y content integer

scope Inner:
  definition y equals x + 1

declaration scope KamerCreatie:
  input grondslag content integer
  inner scope Inner
  output bedrag content integer

scope KamerCreatie:
  definition inner.x equals grondslag
  definition bedrag equals inner.y

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslagen content list of integer
  output totaal content integer

scope Aanslag:
  definition totaal equals
    combine all b
      among (map each g among grondslagen to (output of KamerCreatie with { -- grondslag: g }).bedrag)
      in acc initially 0 with (acc + b)
```
